<p>Hello,</p>
<p>A member of EsignCenter support opened your account, <strong><%= @current_account.name %></strong>, on <%= @started_at %>, viewing it as <strong><%= @viewed_as %></strong>.</p>
<p>Access level: <strong><%= @mode %></strong>. Support can never change your billing, your people, your passwords or your security settings, and can never sign a document as anyone.</p>
<p>Reason given: <em dir="auto"><%= @reason %></em></p>
<p>The session ends automatically after one hour. You can see every support session under Settings → Account.</p>
<p>If you did not ask us for help, reply to this email or write to <%= mail_to @support_email %> straight away.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
